Jenkins Master-Slave setup in details

Slave:
---- add user slave using root --- 
sudo su - 
user add -m slave
--- Generate key pair under /home/slave/.ssh  ---
mkdir .ssh
ssh-keygen
copy id-e25569.pub ---> authorized_keys
chmod 700 auhtorized_keys

copy  content of id_e25569 on jenkins dashboard under the credntial section


Master

switch to jenkins user --- sudo su - jenkins
create dir .ssh under /var/lib/jenkins/
chown jenkins:jenkins .ssh
copy slave ip addr to known_hosts under .ssh ---> ssh-keyscan -H slave_Ipaddr >> /var/lib/jenkins/.ssh/known_hosts
chmod 700 known_hosts




